SUFFIX :&lt;br&gt;
H = Horizontal&lt;br&gt;
V = Vertical &lt;br&gt;
P = Shield pin on housing&lt;br&gt;
B = No mounting holes&lt;br&gt;
S = Pins individually placeable (Single)&lt;br&gt;
D = Direct mounting &lt;p&gt;
